{"id": "EUVD-2026-98934", "enisaUuid": "1e88e590-86b9-3320-a65e-95c9de94983d", "description": "Koillection through 1.8.4 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability that allows authenticated users to upload HTML files as Datum file attachments lacking MIME restrictions. Attackers can upload HTML payloads via POST /api/data/{id}/file, served as text/html from public/uploads, executing JavaScript in victims' sessions to perform actions on their behalf.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T22:12:14", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/benjaminjonard/koillection/issues/1609", "https://github.com/benjaminjonard/koillection/blob/1.8.4/src/Service/ImageHandler.php#L43-L50", "https://github.com/benjaminjonard/koillection/blob/1.8.4/src/Entity/Datum.php#L141-L145", "https://github.com/benjaminjonard/koillection/releases/tag/1.8.4", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/koillection-through-1.8.4-stored-xss-via-datum-file-attachment-uploads"], "aliases": ["GHSA-2rcm-w8cq-6hv5", "CVE-2026-110101"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.22, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "7cc0adec-0443-302a-bf0e-b22265bf6e8d", "product": {"name": "Koillection", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.8.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "dc8255e2-cef7-37e8-b049-8755c5b6e828", "vendor": {"name": "benjaminjonard"}}], "isExploited": false}